message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "dots-vue"
abstract: >
  A Vue 3 front-end application to browse and search TEI corpora published through
  a DoTS (Distributed Text Services) endpoint. dots-vue navigates collection trees,
  displays resources, documents and their metadata, renders IIIF facsimiles with
  Mirador, and queries the dots-cli-es search API for faceted full-text search. Its
  appearance, routing and per-collection behaviour are driven by external settings
  repositories.
type: software
